---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import AboutPage from "../components/views/About.jsx";
---

<BaseLayout title="About — Seoul Walking Tours">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-5 md:px-22 lg:px-32 py-section-lg">
    <div class="flex flex-col-reverse lg:flex-row">
      <div class="flex-2/3">
        <h1 class="text-subsection mb-4">Hey there!</h1>
        <div>
          I'm Jitse, an Amsterdam-born who's been calling Seoul home since early
          2020. This site is where I share glimpses of life as I walk through
          it. Find me with a camera, a notebook, a few pens, and a trusty pair
          of walking shoes and you find me in my element. Moving to Seoul has
          been a blessing. I'm handed a map with seemingly invisible borders,
          urging me to walk and explore the city every day.
          <br />
          <br />
          Want to walk with me? That's certainly possible. You can do so by keeping
          an eye on this space, to enjoy my photography and without a doubt some written
          observations too. But as of now, if you happen to visit Seoul, we can walk
          its streets and nature trails together if you'd like. I'm now available
          as your personal walking tour guide.
          <br />
          <br />
          All opinions, jokes, and photos on this site are mine, please treat them
          as such. Share my work with proper credits, and for any commercial use,
          please ask first - this applies especially to the jokes!
          <br />
          <br />
          If you're curious about my photography, my walking tours through Seoul,
          if have other questions, or just want to chat? Drop me a message! I love
          connecting, sharing stories, and showing you a side of Seoul you might not
          yet know.
          <br />
          <br />
          And hey, my inbox is always open for good lemon ice cream recommendations.
          Do tell!
          <br />
          <br />
          And stay well,
        </div>
        <h3 class="mt-2 font-semibold">Jitse</h3>
      </div>
      <div class="flex-1/3">Photo</div>
    </div>

    <h3 class="text-subsection mt-section-lg mb-4">Get in touch</h3>
    <div class="flex flex-col lg:flex-row gap-8">
      <div class="flex-2/3">
        <p>
          Questions about the tours, curious about Seoul, or have a lemon ice
          cream tip? Send me an email — I read and reply to everything
          personally.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="flex-1/3 flex justify-center items-center">
        <a
          href="mailto:contact@jitsejager.com"
          class="border py-3 px-5 rounded-4xl border-accent-orange-23 text-medium-chromatic-teal"
          >contact@jitsejager.com</a
        >
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
